{
  "name": "all-gated-out",
  "domain": "tech-doc",
  "format": "doc-corpus-and-api-surface",
  "description": "P0 枚举出 5 处可验证断言（5 篇文档各一条链接），P1 把它们全部排除：4 处落在领域包自己的排除规则上（产物目录、构建产物、版本库目录、生成文档），1 处由引擎默认排除规则拦下（依赖目录）。这是「源头有东西、闸门后为空」的边界——必须能被区分于 empty。CHANGED (t23)：本 fixture 现在**不带自己的 gate**——它证明的是「pack 自己能排干」，而不是「pack ∪ fixture 能排干」。",
  "input": {
    "format": "doc-corpus-and-api-surface",
    "payload": {
      "documents": [
        { "path": "node_modules/leftpad/README.md", "title": "leftpad", "sections": [{ "anchor": "usage", "text": "See [the guide](./guide.md)." }] },
        { "path": "dist/api.md", "title": "built api", "sections": [{ "anchor": "usage", "text": "See [the guide](./guide.md)." }] },
        { "path": "build/README.md", "title": "built readme", "sections": [{ "anchor": "usage", "text": "See [the guide](./guide.md)." }] },
        { "path": ".git/hooks/NOTES.md", "title": "hook notes", "sections": [{ "anchor": "usage", "text": "See [the guide](./guide.md)." }] },
        { "path": "generated/api.md", "title": "generated api", "sections": [{ "anchor": "usage", "text": "See [the guide](./guide.md)." }] }
      ],
      "api": []
